<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Heritage Clean - personal WFF v3 analog face for Galaxy Watch 4 (450x450).
  Inspired by Samsung Heritage Classic, decluttered: dark charcoal dial, one accent colour
  (subtle orange or subtle blue, switchable in Customise), three sub-dials (battery, heart rate, steps),
  date + Mumbai time at the top, sword hands, optional seconds hand (Customise toggle).
  v3 preview: accents orange/blue/silver/metallic black, glass numeral badges + sub-dials + pill,
  ECG sweep behind heart rate, AOD day-date window at 3. v2: hour numerals, glass sub-dials + date pill, animated heartbeat (on wake/tap) + ECG trace.
  AOD: orange ticks + orange hour hand, white minute hand with orange rim dot, Mumbai + am/pm.
-->
